{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"agent_message","text":"The history confirms the guard was introduced by H1 on 2026-09-23 and intentionally validates every read address before consulting storage. The new stand-in address is minted by DaoJing in a separate scratch mem store, so the publication store still lacks `k` and the refusal condition remains intact. I’m running the focused JVM namespace now; after it finishes I’ll run the Node and Dart gates remotely, sequentially as required for the generated ANTLR tree."}}
